#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How do I cite Qiskit in my research? {#how-do-i-cite-qiskit-in-my-research}"
msgstr ""
"Bagaimana saya memetik Qiskit dalam penyelidikan saya? {#how-do-i-cite-"
"qiskit-in-my-research}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Cite Qiskit by using the included [BibTeX "
"file](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CITATION.bib).\n"
msgstr ""
"Petik Qiskit dengan menggunakan [fail "
"BibTeX](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CITATION.bib) yang "
"disertakan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How do I cite an IBM Quantum computer in my research? {#how-do-i-cite-an-"
"ibm-quantum-computer-in-my-research}"
msgstr ""
"Bagaimana saya memetik komputer IBM Quantum dalam penyelidikan saya? {#how-"
"do-i-cite-an-ibm-quantum-computer-in-my-research}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For research papers, we encourage authors to acknowledge IBM Quantum&reg; by"
" using:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk kertas penyelidikan, kami menggalakkan penulis mengakui IBM "
"Quantum&reg; dengan menggunakan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
">    We acknowledge the use of IBM Quantum services for this work. The views"
" expressed are those of the authors, and do not reflect the official policy "
"or position of IBM or the IBM Quantum team.\n"
msgstr ""
">    Kami mengakui penggunaan perkhidmatan IBM Quantum untuk kerja ini. "
"Pandangan yang dinyatakan adalah milik penulis, dan tidak mencerminkan dasar"
" atau pendirian rasmi IBM atau pasukan IBM Quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Paper references should use the following citation:\n"
msgstr "Rujukan kertas harus menggunakan petikan berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "> IBM Quantum. https://<span>quantum.cloud.ibm.com</span>/, YYYY\n"
msgstr "> IBM Quantum. https://<span>quantum.cloud.ibm.com</span>/, YYYY\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quantum processing units in the paper should be referenced by their unique name (for example, `ibmq_vigo`) and optionally\n"
"adding the version (for example, `ibmq_vigo` v1.0.2).  We also encourage referencing the processor.\n"
"For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Unit pemprosesan kuantum dalam kertas harus dirujuk dengan nama uniknya (contohnya, `ibmq_vigo`) dan secara pilihan menambahkan versi (contohnya, `ibmq_vigo` v1.0.2). Kami juga menggalakkan merujuk kepada pemproses tersebut.\n"
"Contohnya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> In this paper we used `ibmq_vigo`, which is one of the IBM Quantum Canary "
"processors.\n"
msgstr ""
"> Dalam kertas ini kami menggunakan `ibmq_vigo`, yang merupakan salah satu "
"pemproses IBM Quantum Canary.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example of citing an IBM Quantum program:\n"
msgstr "Contoh memetik program IBM Quantum:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> IBM Quantum (2025). Estimator primitive (Version x.y.z) [computer "
"software]. https://<span>quantum.cloud.ibm.com</span>/\n"
msgstr ""
"> IBM Quantum (2025). Primitif Estimator (Versi x.y.z) [perisian komputer]. "
"https://<span>quantum.cloud.ibm.com</span>/\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How do I cite IBM Quantum Composer in my research? {#how-do-i-cite-ibm-"
"quantum-composer-in-my-research}"
msgstr ""
"Bagaimana saya memetik IBM Quantum Composer dalam penyelidikan saya? {#how-"
"do-i-cite-ibm-quantum-composer-in-my-research}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example citation for IBM Quantum Composer:\n"
msgstr "Contoh petikan untuk IBM Quantum Composer:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> IBM Quantum Composer. 2025. url: "
"https://<span>quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer</span>\n"
msgstr ""
"> IBM Quantum Composer. 2025. url: "
"https://<span>quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer</span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"I don't see something in the user interface, such as my administration "
"tasks. {#i-dont-see-something-in-the-user-interface-such-as-my-"
"administration-tasks}"
msgstr ""
"Saya tidak nampak sesuatu dalam antara muka pengguna, seperti tugas "
"pentadbiran saya. {#i-dont-see-something-in-the-user-interface-such-as-my-"
"administration-tasks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Try choosing a different account from the account switcher in the header of "
"the [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) interface.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cuba pilih akaun yang berbeza daripada penukar akaun di pengepala antara "
"muka [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"I'm just using the Open Plan, but I had to put in my credit card.  Will I be"
" charged? {#im-just-using-the-open-plan-but-i-had-to-put-in-my-credit-card-"
"will-i-be-charged}"
msgstr ""
"Saya hanya menggunakan Open Plan, tetapi saya terpaksa memasukkan kad kredit"
" saya. Adakah saya akan dicaj? {#im-just-using-the-open-plan-but-i-had-to-"
"put-in-my-credit-card-will-i-be-charged}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You will not be charged unless you create a Pay-As-You-Go "
"[instance](/guides/instances) and use it to send workloads to QPUs. See "
"[Manage cost](/guides/manage-cost) for instructions to set a cost limit and "
"to learn about other ways to manage costs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda tidak akan dicaj melainkan anda mencipta [instans](/guides/instances) "
"Pay-As-You-Go dan menggunakannya untuk menghantar beban kerja ke QPU. Lihat "
"[Urus kos](/guides/manage-cost) untuk arahan menetapkan had kos dan untuk "
"mengetahui cara-cara lain mengurus kos.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What's the difference between an API key and an API token? {#whats-the-"
"difference-between-an-api-key-and-an-api-token}"
msgstr ""
"Apakah perbezaan antara kunci API dan token API? {#whats-the-difference-"
"between-an-api-key-and-an-api-token}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There's no difference.  The terms API key and API token are used "
"interchangeably. You'll see both terms in the documentation because "
"different interfaces use different terms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tiada perbezaan. Istilah kunci API dan token API digunakan secara "
"bergantian. Anda akan melihat kedua-dua istilah dalam dokumentasi kerana "
"antara muka yang berbeza menggunakan istilah yang berbeza.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"bearer\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"bearer\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What's the difference between an API token and a bearer token? {#whats-the-"
"difference-between-an-api-token-and-a-bearer-token}"
msgstr ""
"Apakah perbezaan antara token API dan token bearer? {#whats-the-difference-"
"between-an-api-token-and-a-bearer-token}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An API token is a long-lived credential used to [authenticate to the Qiskit "
"Runtime service](/guides/hello-world#install-and-authenticate).  A bearer "
"token is a temporary credential that is used to [authenticate to the REST "
"API in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#authenticate-"
"to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment).  A bearer token cannot be used"
" to authenticate to the Qiskit Runtime service.\n"
msgstr ""
"Token API ialah kelayakan jangka panjang yang digunakan untuk [mengesahkan "
"diri kepada perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime](/guides/hello-world#install-and-"
"authenticate).  Token bearer ialah kelayakan sementara yang digunakan untuk "
"[mengesahkan diri kepada REST API dalam persekitaran yang tidak "
"dipercayai](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-"
"an-untrusted-environment).  Token bearer tidak boleh digunakan untuk "
"mengesahkan diri kepada perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Do I have to choose the region that I live in? {#do-i-have-to-choose-the-"
"region-that-i-live-in}"
msgstr ""
"Adakah saya perlu memilih rantau tempat saya tinggal? {#do-i-have-to-choose-"
"the-region-that-i-live-in}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"No. You can use either region.  The region determines where jobs are run and"
" where the data is kept.  Additionally, you can only see and use instances "
"that were created in the instance that you are logged in to. Note that only "
"the us-east region supports the Open Plan.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tidak. Anda boleh menggunakan mana-mana rantau. Rantau menentukan di mana "
"job dijalankan dan di mana data disimpan. Selain itu, anda hanya boleh "
"melihat dan menggunakan instans yang dicipta dalam instans yang anda log "
"masuk. Perlu diingat bahawa hanya rantau us-east yang menyokong Open Plan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Can I connect through a proxy server? {#can-i-connect-through-a-proxy-"
"server}"
msgstr ""
"Bolehkah saya sambung melalui pelayan proksi? {#can-i-connect-through-a-"
"proxy-server}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Yes, but you must use Qiskit Runtime v0.44.0 or later.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ya, tetapi anda mesti menggunakan Qiskit Runtime v0.44.0 atau lebih "
"baharu.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What is the data retention policy? {#what-is-the-data-retention-policy}"
msgstr "Apakah dasar pengekalan data? {#what-is-the-data-retention-policy}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM retains your (undeleted) job and usage data for three years while you "
"continue to use the Qiskit Runtime service.\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM menyimpan data job dan penggunaan anda (yang tidak dipadam) selama tiga "
"tahun selagi anda terus menggunakan perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What happened to Python distributions such as Qiskit Aer, Qiskit Nature, and"
" Qiskit Experiments? {#what-happened-to-python-distributions-such-as-qiskit-"
"aer-qiskit-nature-and-qiskit-experiments}"
msgstr ""
"Apa yang berlaku kepada pengedaran Python seperti Qiskit Aer, Qiskit Nature,"
" dan Qiskit Experiments? {#what-happened-to-python-distributions-such-as-"
"qiskit-aer-qiskit-nature-and-qiskit-experiments}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Since the release of the Qiskit SDK v1.0, the command `pip install qiskit` "
"will **only** install the [Qiskit SDK](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit). "
"This means that some modules that you have used in the past, such as "
"`qiskit-aer` or `qiskit-nature`, now have to be installed separately.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sejak keluaran Qiskit SDK v1.0, arahan `pip install qiskit` hanya akan "
"memasang [Qiskit SDK](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit) **sahaja**. Ini "
"bermakna beberapa modul yang pernah anda gunakan sebelum ini, seperti "
"`qiskit-aer` atau `qiskit-nature`, kini perlu dipasang secara berasingan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before the release of the Qiskit SDK v1.0, Qiskit was comprised of many "
"different Python distributions, such as `qiskit-terra`, the compiler core; "
"`qiskit-aer`, the high-performance simulator; the original IBM Quantum&reg; "
"provider; and several now-obsolete packages providing particular exploratory"
" algorithmic or experiment-running features.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum keluaran Qiskit SDK v1.0, Qiskit terdiri daripada banyak pengedaran "
"Python yang berbeza, seperti `qiskit-terra`, teras pengkompil; `qiskit-aer`,"
" simulator berprestasi tinggi; pembekal IBM Quantum&reg; asal; dan beberapa "
"pakej yang kini lapuk yang menyediakan ciri algoritma atau eksperimen "
"tertentu yang bersifat penerokaan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These separate software packages were combined into what was called the "
"Qiskit *metapackage*, which allowed users to install all of these components"
" together through `pip install qiskit`. This metapackage architecture was "
"removed with the release of the Qiskit SDK v1.0, and now each of the "
"individual software distributions needs to be installed separately.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pakej perisian yang berasingan ini digabungkan menjadi apa yang dikenali "
"sebagai *metapackage* Qiskit, yang membolehkan pengguna memasang semua "
"komponen ini bersama-sama melalui `pip install qiskit`. Seni bina "
"metapackage ini dihapuskan dengan keluaran Qiskit SDK v1.0, dan kini setiap "
"pengedaran perisian individu perlu dipasang secara berasingan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you want to install the packages that were previously included in the "
"Qiskit metapackage, visit the [Qiskit "
"ecosystem](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem) to find a range of "
"packages to suit your needs. You can also read the [v1.0 migration "
"guide](/guides/metapackage-migration) for more information about this "
"change.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda ingin memasang pakej yang sebelum ini disertakan dalam metapackage"
" Qiskit, lawati [ekosistem Qiskit](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem) "
"untuk mencari pelbagai pakej yang sesuai dengan keperluan anda. Anda juga "
"boleh membaca [panduan migrasi v1.0](/guides/metapackage-migration) untuk "
"maklumat lanjut tentang perubahan ini.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How do I close my IBM Cloud account? {#how-do-i-close-my-ibm-cloud-account}"
msgstr ""
"Bagaimana saya menutup akaun IBM Cloud saya? {#how-do-i-close-my-ibm-cloud-"
"account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Find instructions on the [Closing an "
"account](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-close) "
"page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cari arahan di halaman [Menutup "
"akaun](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-close).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Why do I see a message that my account is inactive when I try to log on? "
"{#why-do-i-see-a-message-that-my-account-is-inactive-when-i-try-to-log-on}"
msgstr ""
"Mengapa saya melihat mesej bahawa akaun saya tidak aktif semasa cuba log "
"masuk? {#why-do-i-see-a-message-that-my-account-is-inactive-when-i-try-to-"
"log-on}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you see the message \"This account is inactive\", visit the [IBM Cloud "
"documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"ts_accnt_inactive) to learn why and how to fix it, or access [IBM "
"Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) to verify whether you have any pending actions"
" to complete in your account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda melihat mesej \"This account is inactive\", lawati [dokumentasi "
"IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"ts_accnt_inactive) untuk mengetahui sebab dan cara menyelesaikannya, atau "
"akses [IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) untuk mengesahkan sama ada terdapat"
" sebarang tindakan yang perlu anda selesaikan dalam akaun anda.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What is the impact of device drift? {#what-is-the-impact-of-device-drift}"
msgstr "Apakah impak hanyutan peranti? {#what-is-the-impact-of-device-drift}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The impact of device drift (hardware performance that degrades over time) "
"depends on many factors, such as when calibrations were last run, the "
"specific experiment performed, any TLS activities, and so on. If a "
"particular workload is very sensitive to device parameters' error values, "
"you can perform a real-time device parameter benchmarking by following [this"
" tutorial](/tutorials/real-time-benchmarking-for-qubit-selection) in IBM "
"Quantum Learning.\n"
msgstr ""
"Impak hanyutan peranti (prestasi perkakasan yang merosot dari semasa ke "
"semasa) bergantung kepada banyak faktor, seperti masa kalibrasi terakhir "
"dijalankan, eksperimen spesifik yang dilakukan, sebarang aktiviti TLS, dan "
"sebagainya. Jika beban kerja tertentu sangat sensitif terhadap nilai ralat "
"parameter peranti, anda boleh melakukan penanda aras parameter peranti masa "
"nyata dengan mengikuti [tutorial ini](/tutorials/real-time-benchmarking-for-"
"qubit-selection) dalam IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
